        "TileImage": "$($repository 702e7077-2629-47d2-a212-6f450b179939).Image",
        "Description": "Be a waiter, they said.\rCome to Sgail, they said.\rRub shoulders with the glamorous, they said.\rBe adored at the best parties, they said.\r\rWell, he -never- got invited to the wild parties. So he and his close friends are catching the nearest comet to a better place. But they need help setting up their celestial transition.\r\rGet this done,  and the next time you look up at the sky and see a shooting star, it&apos;s Muff and Friends enjoying their time at the greatest party in the universe.",
